cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these findings, please cite the work as below."
title: "Xiamen Shared-Bicycle Tidal Imbalance: measuring the detour factor and rebalancing zones from five mornings of GPS data"
abstract: >-
  Reconstructs 212,680 bike-share trips from five mornings of Xiamen order, fence, trajectory
  and weather data, measures the detour factor omega from 2,849,243 GPS fixes, and compares a
  flow-based community partition of the origin-destination network against a published
  distance-plus-demand affinity clustering. All code is reproducible from a single entry point.
